{#
settings/_images.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Whether remote images in mail load without the "Show images" bar (#124).

A plain form that submits on change and redirects, like Disposal beside it:
the switch decides how the NEXT message is drawn, so there is nothing on this
page worth streaming back.

Off to begin with, and the hint says what turning it on gives away — that a
message was opened — and the two things it does not: the reader's address,
because images still come through plMail, and mail in Spam, which stays
blocked whatever this says.

Below it, the senders whose images always load (#807): every entry, domains
first, each with its own remove button, and one field that adds several at
once. The list is the allowlist the "Always show images from …" buttons on a
message build; until this card it could not be seen at all, only undone one
message at a time. Entries are addresses, patterns (`invoice+*@stripe.com`)
or whole domains, each with its own icon. Remove all asks first, through the
app's own dialog.

Accepts:
  alwaysShow  bool
  senders     list<TrustedImageSender>
#}
{% import '_partials/_segmented.html.twig' as seg %}

<div class="px-4 py-3">

<form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_images_update') }}" data-controller="ui--auto-submit">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-images') }}">

    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="min-w-0">
            <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ 'settings.images.always_show'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ 'settings.images.always_show_hint'|trans }}</span>
        </span>

        {{ seg.control('alwaysShow', [
            { value: '1', label: 'settings.images.on'|trans },
            { value: '0', label: 'settings.images.off'|trans },
        ], alwaysShow ? '1' : '0', {
            label:  'settings.images.always_show'|trans,
            action: 'change->ui--auto-submit#submit',
        }) }}
    </div>
</form>

</div>

<div class="px-4 py-3 border-t border-line space-y-3" data-testid="trusted-image-senders">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
        <span class="min-w-0">
            <span class="block text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">{{ 'settings.images.senders.heading'|trans }}</span>
            <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-faint mt-0.5">{{ 'settings.images.senders.hint'|trans }}</span>
        </span>

        {% if senders is not empty %}
            <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_images_senders_clear') }}" class="shrink-0"
                  data-turbo-confirm="{{ 'settings.images.senders.clear_confirm'|trans({'%count%': senders|length}) }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-images-senders-clear') }}">
                <button type="submit" data-testid="trusted-image-senders-clear"
                        class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint hover:text-red-400 transition-colors cursor-pointer">
                    {{ 'settings.images.senders.clear'|trans }}
                </button>
            </form>
        {% endif %}
    </div>

    <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_images_senders_add') }}" class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-images-senders') }}">
        <input type="text" name="entries" required
               autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false"
               data-1p-ignore data-lpignore="true"
               aria-label="{{ 'settings.images.senders.add_label'|trans }}"
               placeholder="{{ 'settings.images.senders.placeholder'|trans }}"
               data-testid="trusted-image-senders-input"
               class="min-w-0 flex-1 h-9 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface px-3 text-sm text-ink
                      placeholder:text-ink-faint focus:border-accent focus:outline-none">
        <button type="submit"
                class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 h-9 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border border-line text-ink hover:bg-hover transition-colors cursor-pointer">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            {{ 'settings.images.senders.add'|trans }}
        </button>
    </form>

    {% if senders is empty %}
        <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-faint italic">{{ 'settings.images.senders.empty'|trans }}</p>
    {% else %}
        <ul class="divide-y divide-line rounded-lg border border-line">
            {% for sender in senders %}
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2" data-testid="trusted-image-sender">
                    <i class="fa-solid {{ sender.isDomain ? 'fa-globe' : (sender.isPattern ? 'fa-asterisk' : 'fa-at') }} text-ink-faint text-xs shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span class="flex-1 min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-ink" title="{{ sender.address }}">
                        {% if sender.isDomain %}
                            {{ 'settings.images.senders.domain'|trans({'%domain%': sender.address|slice(2)}) }}
                        {% else %}
                            {{ sender.address }}
                        {% endif %}
                    </span>
                    <form method="post" action="{{ path('app_settings_images_senders_remove', {id: sender.id}) }}" class="shrink-0">
                        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('settings-images-sender-remove' ~ sender.id) }}">
                        <button type="submit"
                                aria-label="{{ 'settings.images.senders.remove'|trans({'%entry%': sender.address}) }}"
                                data-tooltip="{{ 'settings.images.senders.remove'|trans({'%entry%': sender.address}) }}"
                                class="w-7 h-7 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-ink-faint hover:text-red-400 hover:bg-hover transition-colors cursor-pointer">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xs" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    {% endif %}
</div>
